  ],
  "answer": 1,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "R is a true property, but it doesn't apply here because 2 × 3 = 6 > 1. For x, y > 0 with xy > 1 the sum is π + tan⁻¹((x + y)/(1 − xy)) = π + tan⁻¹(−1) = π − π/4 = 3π/4. So A is true, but R does not explain it."
